    %% Architecture Connections
    AzureFrontDoor -->|User HTTPS requests| AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair
    AzureFrontDoor -->|User HTTPS requests| AzureApplicationGatewayKLM
    AzureApplicationGatewayFinnair -->|Tenant-specific web traffic| AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal
    AzureApplicationGatewayKLM -->|Tenant-specific web traffic| AzureAppServiceKLMPortal
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|API calls via Private Endpoint| AzureAPIManagement
    AzureAppServiceKLMPortal -->|API calls via Private Endpoint| AzureAPIManagement
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API calls for booking services| AzureFunctionsBooking
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API calls for payment services| AzureFunctionsPayment
    AzureFunctionsBooking -->|SQL queries over Private Link| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureFunctionsPayment -->|SQL queries over Private Link| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureFunctionsNotification -->|Cache-aside pattern| AzureRedisCache
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Secrets retrieval via Managed Identity| AzureKeyVaultFinnair
    AzureAppServiceKLMPortal -->|Secrets retrieval via Managed Identity| AzureKeyVaultKLM
    AzureFunctionsBooking -->|Secrets retrieval via Managed Identity| AzureKeyVaultShared
    AzureMonitor -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal
    AzureMonitor -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureAppServiceKLMPortal
    AzureMonitor -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzureFunctionsBooking
    AzureMonitor -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| AzurePostgreSQL
    AzureFirewall -->|Traffic filtering and protection| AzureFrontDoor
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API gateway routing| AzureFunctionsCustomer
    AzureAPIManagement -->|API gateway routing| AzureFunctionsAnalytics
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| ApplicationInsights
    AzureAppServiceFinnairPortal -->|Telemetry & diagnostics| LogAnalyticsWorkspace
    AzureFrontDoor -->|Security monitoring| MicrosoftDefenderforCloud
    AzureFunctionsAnalytics -->|SQL queries over Private Link| AzurePostgreSQL

